<title>USA: Top 25 manufacturers by net profit - survey.</title>
<headline>Top 25 manufacturers by net profit - survey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the top 25 manufacturing companies by net income, according to an IndustryWeek magazine survey compiled with Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp. and Moody's Investors Service.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>Company			 Country    Net Income    Revenue</p>
<p>Royal Dutch Petroleum Co. Netherlands$9.6 billion $139 billion</p>
