<p>General Electric Co.	U.S.	 $7.3 billion  $79 billion</p>
<p>Philip Morris Cos. Inc.   U.S.	 $6.3 billion  $69 billion</p>
<p>International Business</p>
<p> Machines Corp.	     U.S.	 $5.4 billion  $76 billion</p>
<p>Intel Corp.		   U.S.	 $5.2 billion  $21 billion</p>
<p>General Motors Corp.	U.S.	 $5.0 billion $164 billion</p>
<p>Ford Motor Co.		U.S.	 $4.4 billion $147 billion</p>
<p>British Petroleum Co. Plc U.K.	 $4.3 billion  $76 billion</p>
<p>Merck &amp; Co. Inc.	    U.S.	 $3.9 billion  $20 billion</p>
<p>Du Pont &amp; Co.		 U.S.	 $3.6 billion  $45 billion</p>
<p>Chrysler Corp.		U.S.	 $3.5 billion  $61 billion</p>
