<p>Samsung Electronics</p>
<p> Co. Ltd.		     South Korea$2.9 billion  $19 billion</p>
<p>Roche Holding Ltd.	  Switzerland$2.9 billion  $12 billion</p>
<p>Johnson &amp; Johnson	   U.S.	 $2.9 billion  $22 billion</p>
<p>W.R. Grace &amp; Co.	    U.S.	 $2.9 billion   $3.5 billion</p>
<p>Bristol-Myers Squibb Co.  U.S.	 $2.9 billion  $15 billion</p>
